  "details": "Previous behavior allowed the Personal Mirror in Immersive Mode to be grabbed with the trigger and push/pulled by touching north or south on the right (turning) touchpad.\n\nOn live when you grab with trigger lightly, the mirror can still be picked up but anything more than about 75% on the trigger will drop the mirror. (Similar to the [Physbone Posing problem](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1491-vive-controllers-physbone-pose-w-trigger-full-pull-is-unintuitive)) The push/pull functionality is locked behind clicking the touchpad instead of touching, so you'll jump or mute your mic when attempting to use it.",
